Package: apparmor.d-sync
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: apparmor, python3, python3-apparmor
Maintainer: Maxime Bélair <maxime.belair@canonical.com>
Description: AppArmor profiles with runtime profile-set selection
 Ships the full apparmor.d profile set read-only under /usr/share/apparmor.d
 and aa-sync, which selects and loads the subset matching the local policy
 (stable profiles whose binary is installed, by default). The loaded set is
 kept in sync on package-manager transactions and checked daily for drift.
